      "content": "Saasment API provides programmatic access to AI-powered SaaS security posture management (SSPM) and cloud cost optimization capabilities. The API enables automated security configuration scanning, compliance assessment, misconfiguration detection, breach and attack simulation, privileged access management, and cost optimization recommendations across your SaaS and cloud application estate.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Saasment Support",
